Cell["\<\
Three fibrations over the same grid: a product with a triangle, the tangent \
bundle at scale 2 and the displacement bundle at scale 1.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"bbf5ecb4-911c-4a3a-af2c-600a2955dba0"],

